ith admin-controlled inventory.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Analytics Dashboard",\n      "description": "Personal and team dashboards with trends, heatmaps, reports, and performance metrics.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Glassy UI & UX Design",\n      "description": "Modern glassmorphism UI with frosted cards, neon effects, dark/light mode, responsive layout, and engaging animations.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Notifications & Integrations",\n      "description": "Slack/Discord bots and email notifications for points, disputes, and redemptions; integrations with Jira, Trello, Asana.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Security & Fairness Mechanisms",\n      "description": "Rate limiting, peer validation, audit trails, bias detection, and future AI suggestions for fairness and security.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "FastAPI"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#020d1d",\n    "secondary": "#9CA3AF",\n    "accent": "#013951"\n  },\n  "theme": "dark",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI features a glassmorphism design with frosted cards and translucent overlays. The dashboard displays cards for PRs, points, bugs, and redemption options. Neon hover effects, dark/light toggle, and responsive layouts ensure a modern experience. Real-time updates, confetti animations, and interactive elements enhance engagement."\n}'}",
